Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="exchange_rates_test.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

date, currency_pair, rate
2026-05-20, INR-USD, 0.012050
2026-05-21, INR-USD, 0.012100
2026-05-22, INR-USD, 0.012150
2026-05-20, NPR-USD, 0.007510
2026-05-21, NPR-USD, 0.007520
2026-05-22, NPR-USD, 0.007530
------WebKitFormBoundary--

> {%
